{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"bada439ec3d1771a6dba845bcbadb0356ad3a4656f47994c8bb66cdcb1c9a87b"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:826afec635560a69aaeabb94d5ffd276add9e46894c32c08f6267b9e8bb2a5a5","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Gardening","evidence":"[D29:7 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Deborah: Thanks, Jolene! It was really special. My mom had a big passion for cooking. She would make amazing meals for us, each one full of love and warmth. I can still remember the smell of her special dish, it would fill the house and bring us all together.","itemId":"urn:uuid:213fb7ef-4329-5af3-82ae-785861ae782c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ad97d4c2d0d44671912bdae660a1380564c1601be28cb2b04ec436a79098ae6b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What was Deborah's mom passionate about?","referenceAnswer":"Cooking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ad97d4c2d0d44671912bdae660a1380564c1601be28cb2b04ec436a79098ae6b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}